1
00:00:00,607 --> 00:00:04,657
(Howard:)So nice you could join me this evening.
You're looking lovely as always.

2
00:00:06,488 --> 00:00:07,618
(Katee Sackhoff:)Thanks, Howard.

3
00:00:07,781 --> 00:00:11,161
(Katee Sackhoff:)Always nice to be part
of your masturbatory fantasies.

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,452
(Howard:)Come on, Katee,
don't make it sound so cheap.

5
00:00:15,622 --> 00:00:20,462
(Katee:)I'm sorry. Fiddling with yourself
in the bathtub is a real class act.

6
00:00:21,795 --> 00:00:23,295
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

7
00:00:23,463 --> 00:00:26,963
So, ahem, shall we get started?

8
00:00:28,135 --> 00:00:31,135
(Katee:)Sure, but can I ask you
a question first?

9
00:00:31,305 --> 00:00:33,515
You wanna play Cylon and colonist?

10
00:00:33,682 --> 00:00:36,522
No, I wanna know why
you're playing make-believe with me...

11
00:00:36,685 --> 00:00:39,395
(Katee:)...when you could be out
with a real woman tonight.

12
00:00:39,563 --> 00:00:42,983
(Howard:)-You mean Bernadette?
-No, I mean Princess Leia.

13
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:45,150
(Katee:)Of course I mean Bernadette.

14
00:00:45,319 --> 00:00:47,739
(Katee:)She's a wonderful girl
and she really likes you.

15
00:00:48,155 --> 00:00:52,655
(Howard:)-I know, but she's not you.
-I'm not me.

16
00:00:53,327 --> 00:00:56,537
(Katee:)The real me is in Beverly Hills
with a tall, handsome rich guy.

17
00:00:56,705 --> 00:00:58,665
(Howard:)-Really? Tall?
-Six-four.

